NOTICE
======

Origin, authorship and licence status of every component under this directory, so
that attribution is unambiguous and the boundary between this project's own work
and third-party work is clear.

SCOPE, STATED PLAINLY: this directory is NOT a byte-for-byte complete copy of the
upstream repository. 168 of the 207 tracked upstream files are here. The 39 that
are not are the two asset groups whose third-party rights are unresolved - authored
by people other than the environment's author, carrying no licence of their own
(section 3).

Nothing is missing silently: section 3 names both groups and section 6 enumerates
every one of the 39 excluded paths. All 207 upstream files are preserved in full in
a private snapshot outside this repository, with a per-file SHA-256 manifest.

The colcon build output under ir_base/models/{build,install,log}/ IS included,
byte-identical. It is the environment author's own generated output and falls under
the same permission; it also embeds his local filesystem path, which is his to
publish - the upstream repository is public and has always carried it.

