7. EXTERNAL RUNTIME DEPENDENCY, NOT VENDORED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  The Gazebo worlds include a model fetched from Gazebo Fuel:

    https://fuel.gazebosim.org/1.0/OpenRobotics/models/Sun

  Gazebo caches Fuel models after their first download, so this needs network
  access once and then works offline. It is an Open Robotics model under its own
  licence and is deliberately not redistributed here.
